public","site_admin":false},"body":"Another alternative that closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11238\r\nFollows up #100135\r\nFor the discussion, see the proposal\r\n\r\n`@hide_from_dialog` allows you to hide a global script with a global type name hidden from the create dialog. `@suffix` allows you to set a custom suffix for the script. A custom suffix will replace the file name with the suffix you set. An empty custom suffix will hide the suffix from all create dialogs.\r\nE.g.\r\n```GDScript\r\n@suffix(\"Custom suffix\")\r\nclass_name MyClass\r\nextends Node\r\n```\r\nthis will turn\r\n```\r\nNode\r\n| - MyClass (my_class.gd)\r\n```\r\ninto\r\n```\r\nNode\r\n| - MyClass (Custom suffix)\r\n```\r\n\r\n# Note\r\nI added few protected variables in `Script` class and getter methods, which is beneficial for the future continuations based on this pr\r\n\r\nAlternative: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100349\r\nOnly one of the two pr will be merged, and the other one will be closed if not.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-12-21T09:10:20Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T13:11:45Z","closed_at":"2024-12-21T13:06:06Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"21358b08b0eed6c6c3ac026b6f3582ec2033f5a4","assignee":n